# Almanac API (`pathfinder/`)

This repo is **API-only** — Next.js `/api/*`, Prisma, domain + AI libs for the Expo client in `pathfinder-mobile/`.

**Canonical agent rules:** [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md)

**Read first:** [`../PATHFINDER-DECISIONS-LOG.md`](../PATHFINDER-DECISIONS-LOG.md) · [`../PATHFINDER-CORRECTED-FACTS.md`](../PATHFINDER-CORRECTED-FACTS.md)

**Desktop web UI:** removed — see [`DESKTOP-ON-HOLD.md`](./DESKTOP-ON-HOLD.md). Do not extend retired tree/map UI.

**After changes:** `npx tsc --noEmit` · `npm test` when touching `src/lib/`

**Never touch without asking:** `prisma/schema.prisma`, NextAuth config, `src/app/api/auth/`

**AI:** Gemini primary (`USE_REFLECT_CALL=true` in prod); keep AI calls in `/api` routes only.
